    "description": {
      "value": "Thorns sprout from your body; they pass through and don't damage any clothing or armor you wear. Adjacent creatures that hit you with a melee or unarmed attack take 1d4 piercing damage as the nettles jab them and break off. Each time a creature takes damage in this way, nettleskin's duration decreases by 1 round."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 1d4."
